    "original_text": "Exact independently sealed bounded statement:\nFinite-dimensional real Hilbert/Borel full E including0. Actual C2 potential W, ordinary-volume exp(-W) integrability and positive partition. Actual normalized probability mu=volume.tilted(-W).\nBOTH actual global mI<=HessW<=MI and0<m<=M. SAME exact original compact-smooth closable weighted gradient D BEFORE ALL mean-zero z in D.closure.domain. No input Poincare or supplied resolvent/coercivity/limit certificate. This canonical library contract is narrower than lower-only source D6.\nFor every genuinely centered z in the SAME original closed weighted-gradient domain, prove m*normz^2<=normDclosurez^2 from actual positive-epsilon solutions, SAME variational uniqueness, global coercivity and true strong scaled residual limit.\nFinite-dimensional real Hilbert/Borel full E including0, genuine C2 W with actual exponential integrability/positive partition, normalized tilted probability, BOTH global mI<=HessW<=MI and0<m<=M. SAME original exact compact-smooth closable weighted gradient D BEFORE all truly mean-zero domain z. Actual positiveepsilon variational solutions from residual/globalcoercivity producers are identified by SAME D/epsilon/forcing uniqueness, then tested against z; strong scaled residual limit and genuine scalar Cauchy-Schwarz/zero-norm branch give m*normz^2<=normDclosurez^2. No uniform unscaled solution bound, centered resolvent, epsilon0 solution, core/range/adjoint certificate or input Poincare. Actual C1 scalar/gradientL2 pairs and centered function are admitted to a genuine original graph, actual probability/AE quotient identities and real integrability produce Admissible and m*Var<=DirichletEnergy. Actual common Gaussian J/R/S, sourceC2 alpha-beta eta cap, reflected W_y, positive partitions and one original D_y precede allcentered z/score directions; actual unnormalized parameter-y score variance <=(eta^-1-alpha)^2*norma^2/(4*(alpha+eta^-1)), with exact reflected m=(alpha+eta^-1)/4 and source-derived upper M=(beta+eta^-1)/4. Auxiliary normalized density equality only; no R2=R/alternateD identification/jointselector or normalized conditional density derivative. BOTH-curvature generic statement is narrower than lower-only source D6 and is disclosed; source companion models supply the upper bound. Anisotropic BL, unreflected linear moments/covariance-upper and SPHMC Hessian lower, outer-y/marginal Poincare, PBPS sampler/reflection/invariance/nonexplosion/hypocoercivity/implementation/cost, SPHMC complete algorithm/Wp/proxywarmness, main results/composition/expectedcost remainopen. TV does not transfer unbounded cost.",
